			<item>
				<title>One Cable to Run Everything: CalDigit TS4</title>
				<link>http://localhost:3001/reviews/caldigit-ts4/</link>
				<pubDate>Thu, 19 Mar 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>http://localhost:3001/reviews/caldigit-ts4/</guid>
				<description>&lt;aside class=&#34;takeaways&#34;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;p class=&#34;takeaways-h&#34;&gt;The 30-second verdict&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;  &lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;18 ports — including 2.5GbE, front SD and USB — cover a full desk setup.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;98W charging keeps a 16-inch laptop powered under sustained load.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Stable sleep/wake behavior on both macOS and Windows.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Enough bandwidth for dual displays plus fast external storage at once.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&#xA;  &#xA;  &lt;a class=&#34;btn btn-primary&#34; href=&#34;https://www.amazon.com/s?k=CalDigit&amp;#43;TS4&amp;#43;Thunderbolt&amp;#43;4&amp;#43;Dock&amp;amp;tag=csuitnec-20&amp;amp;linkCode=ll2&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;sponsored nofollow noopener&#34; data-affiliate=&#34;CalDigit TS4 Thunderbolt 4 Dock&#34; data-cta=&#34;takeaways&#34;&gt;Check Price on Amazon&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;  &lt;a class=&#34;takeaways-jump&#34; href=&#34;#full-review&#34;&gt;Or read the full breakdown ↓&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;  &#xA;&lt;/aside&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;the-single-cable-promise-delivered&#34;&gt;The single-cable promise, delivered&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;You sit down, plug in one Thunderbolt cable, and your laptop has two monitors, wired networking, all your peripherals and a full charge. The TS4 is the dock that does this reliably instead of dropping a display on wake. If your desk is a mess of dongles, &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.amazon.com/s?k=CalDigit&amp;#43;TS4&amp;#43;Thunderbolt&amp;#43;4&amp;#43;Dock&amp;amp;tag=csuitnec-20&amp;amp;linkCode=ll2&#34; class=&#34;out aff&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;sponsored nofollow noopener&#34; data-affiliate=&#34;CalDigit TS4 Thunderbolt 4 Dock&#34; data-cta=&#34;in-content&#34;&gt;check the Amazon price&lt;svg class=&#34;out-ico&#34; width=&#34;12&#34; height=&#34;12&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 24 24&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34;&gt;&lt;path d=&#34;M7 17 17 7M9 7h8v8&#34; fill=&#34;none&#34; stroke=&#34;currentColor&#34; stroke-width=&#34;2.5&#34; stroke-linecap=&#34;round&#34; stroke-linejoin=&#34;round&#34;/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
